# Form Handling

- Validate at field, form, and **server** layers; never trust client-only checks.
- Accessible labels (not placeholder-only); errors near fields + `aria-invalid`/`aria-describedby`; not color-only.
- Preserve input on network failure; idempotency keys when needed; reuse project form patterns.

Korean rationale: `docs/pvc-guide/ko/patterns/form-handling.md`
